{"id":"02d13ca813f4498f","group":"20","path":"20/20-prop-least-nontrivial-mdegree.md","title":"非平凡可计算集合的共同 m 度","display":"prop-least-nontrivial-mdegree — 非平凡可计算集合的共同 m 度","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-prop-least-nontrivial-mdegree","aliases":["20-prop-least-nontrivial-mdegree"],"display":"prop-least-nontrivial-mdegree — 非平凡可计算集合的共同 m 度","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 1.6.29","source_printed_pages":[19],"source_pdf_pages":[55],"depends_on":["[[20-df-mred]]","[[20-df-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-prop-least-nontrivial-mdegree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-prop-least-nontrivial-mdegree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-least-nontrivial-mdegree — 非平凡可计算集合的共同 m 度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 1.6.29"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>19</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>55</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne B\\ne\\omega\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne B\\ne\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}least\\text{-}nontrivial\\text{-}mdegree}\\vdash\nA\\le_m B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}least\\text{-}nontrivial\\text{-}mdegree}\\vdash\nA\\le_m B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定 b₁∈B 和 b₀∉B，按可判定的 A 定义 f(x)=b₁ 或 b₀。它见证归约。对两个非平凡可计算集合应用两次即可得同一 m 度。取点是非统一的；定理不提供从任意 B 的描述计算两个点的算法。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 1.6.29；印刷页 19；PDF 第 55 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne B\\ne\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}least\\text{-}nontrivial\\text{-}mdegree}\\vdash\nA\\le_m B.","display":true}],"bytes":1208,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-370","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-prop-least-nontrivial-mdegree]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-370","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-prop-least-nontrivial-mdegree]]"}],"outgoing":["d5dada982b721c80","d6dc5974baa6f8a5"]}